  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.1000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">清华大学资产处拟对清华大学建筑物防雷年度检测服务项目进行采购，现邀请国内合格供应商前来报名。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">一、项目概况</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、主要内容：对学校既有房屋的防雷装置进行常规检测，包括教学科研楼宇、公共建筑、学生宿舍、家属住宅等</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">300</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">余栋。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、计划工期：合同签订后</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">60</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">日历天</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、控制价：</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">35</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">万元</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">二、报名供应商应符合政府采购法第二十二条相关规定并提供以下资料：</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、独立法人，且有针对本项目的法定代表人授权委托书（原件，且在授权书上注明经办人联系方式）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、有效的营业执照（复印件，加盖公章）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、气象主管机构核发的雷电防护装置检测资质（复印件，加盖公章）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、近三年已完成的建筑物防雷检测项目业绩清单（指</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">2023</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">8</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">月至今，需注明年份、甲方联系人和联系方式，且有合同关键页复印件并加盖公章）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、未被信用中国网站（</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">www.creditchina.gov.cn</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">）列入失信被执行人、重大税收违法案件当事人名单、政府采购严重违法失信行为记录名单的网页截图，截图时间应为报名时间（打印，加盖公章）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、供应商认为与本项目相关的其他资料（复印件，加盖公章）。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">三、报名方式与要求</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、须将上述原件扫描或复印件加盖公章扫描后压缩成一个</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">PDF</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">文件，文件名为</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">“</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">项目名称</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">+</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">公司全称</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">”</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">，发送至邮箱：</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">liuqian0351</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">@mail.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、报名时间：</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">月</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">2</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">日至</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">月</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">28</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">日，此日期范围以外的报名将不被接收。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">联系人：刘老师</font></span></span></span>  <span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">电话：</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">627</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">72005</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-right:-4px; margin-left:19px; text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#444444\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#444444\"><font face=\"宋体\">、本项目不接受联合体报名，采购单位将从报名供应商中选择参与供应商，受到邀请的供应商将在两周以内接到通知并进入下一采购环节，未被邀请者恕不另行通知。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "清华大学资产处拟对清华大学建筑物防雷年度检测服务项目进行采购，现邀请国内合格供应商前来报名。 一、项目概况 1 、主要内容：对学校既有房屋的防雷装置进行常规检测，包括教学科研楼宇、公共建筑、学生宿舍、家属住宅等 300 余栋。 2 、计划工期：合同签订后 60 日历天 3 、控制价： 35 万元 二、报名供应商应符合政府采购法第二十二条相关规定并提供以下资料： 1 、独立法人，且有针对本项目的法定代表人授权委托书（原件，且在授权书上注明经办人联系方式）； 2 、有效的营业执照（复印件，加盖公章）； 3 、气象主管机构核发的雷电防护装置检测资质（复印件，加盖公章）； 4 、近三年已完成的建筑物防雷检测项目业绩清单（指 2023 年 8 月至今，需注明年份、甲方联系人和联系方式，且有合同关键页复印件并加盖公章）； 5 、未被信用中国网站（ www.creditchina.gov.cn ）列入失信被执行人、重大税收违法案件当事人名单、政府采购严重违法失信行为记录名单的网页截图，截图时间应为报名时间（打印，加盖公章）； 6 、供应商认为与本项目相关的其他资料（复印件，加盖公章）。 三、报名方式与要求 1 、须将上述原件扫描或复印件加盖公章扫描后压缩成一个 PDF 文件，文件名为 “ 项目名称 + 公司全称 ” ，发送至邮箱： liuqian0351 @mail.tsinghua.edu.cn 。 2 、报名时间： 2026 年 8 月 2 6 日至 2026 年 8 月 28 日，此日期范围以外的报名将不被接收。 联系人：刘老师 电话： 627 72005 3 、本项目不接受联合体报名，采购单位将从报名供应商中选择参与供应商，受到邀请的供应商将在两周以内接到通知并进入下一采购环节，未被邀请者恕不另行通知。",
